An [[Afflicted Necromancer]] is an [[undead]] [[necromancer]] corrupted by the malevolent spirit of [[Shiro Tagachi]]. They are always encountered in a group with other [[Afflicted]]. Compared to Afflicted of other professions, they are not as dangerous.

